e-ad-temporary-access-pass-and-microsoft-graph/\">Onboarding users in ASP.NET Core using Azure AD Temporary Access Pass and Microsoft Graph</a> (Damien Bowden)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.roundthecode.com/dotnet/data-annotation-model-validation-aspnet-core\">Data Annotations for model validation in ASP.NET Core</a> (David Grace)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://coderethinked.com/break-out-of-foreach-loop-in-javascript/\">Break out of forEach loop in JavaScript</a> (Karthik Chintala)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://code.tutsplus.com/tutorials/sorting-values-with-javascript--net-7837\">Sorting Values With JavaScript</a> (Kingsley Ubah)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.telerik.com/blogs/angular-basics-troubleshooting-unknown-element-errors\">Angular Basics: Troubleshooting Unknown Element Errors</a> (Vyom Srivastava)</li>\n<li><a href=\"http://apievangelist.com/2023/02/26/the-most-important-api-layers-to-focus-on-in-the-enterprise/\">The Most Important API Layers To Focus on in the Enterprise</a> (Kin Lane)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://eslint.org/blog/2023/02/eslint-v8.35.0-released/\">ESLint v8.35.0 released</a> (Brandon Mills)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thenewstack.io/is-webassembly-really-the-future/\">Is WebAssembly Really the Future?</a> (B. Cameron Gain)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blog.developer.adobe.com/peek-into-adobe-edge-server-api-aeeefd698668?source=rss----9342990108af---4\">Peek into Adobe Edge Server API</a> (Deepali Rathi)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://jfarrell.net/2023/02/26/create-a-private-function-app/\">Create a Private Function App</a> (Jason Farrell)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://markheath.net/post/dapr-1-10\">Dapr 1.10 – More steps in the right direction</a> (Mark Heath)</li>\n</ul><p></p>\n<h3><a></a>WinUI, .NET MAUI &amp; XAML</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://doumer.me/uploading-your-xamarin-or-maui-ios-app-to-the-app-store-without-vs-for-mac/\">Uploading Your Xamarin or MAUI iOS app to the App Store Without VS for Mac</a> (Damien Doumer)</li>\n</ul><p>